**Pipeline expectations.** $\omega_0 \approx 6.325\ \mathrm{rad/s}$, $\zeta \approx 0.0632$ (underdamped), $\omega_d \approx 6.312\ \mathrm{rad/s}$, $T_d \approx 0.9954\ \mathrm s$, and log decrement $\approx 0.398$. C7 solves the ODE exactly (constant coefficients, complex roots) and names the method in the steps. The energy $E(t)$ is checked to be non-increasing. The phase portrait spirals in.
